USER_REGISTER:
Dear {$recipientName},

Thank you for registering with {$journalName}. Your username is {$username}.

{$signature}

PASSWORD_RESET_CONFIRM:
We have received a request to reset your password for the {$journalName} web site.

If you did not make this request, please ignore this email and your password will not be changed. If you wish to reset your password, click on the below URL.

Reset my password: {$passwordResetUrl}

{$signature}

PASSWORD_RESET:
Your password has been successfully reset for use with the {$journalName} web site. Please retain this username and password, as it is necessary for all work with the journal.

Your username: {$username}
Password: {$password}

{$signature}

SUBMISSION_ACK:
Dear {$authorName},

Thank you for submitting "{$submissionTitle}" to {$journalName}. You can track it at {$submissionUrl}.

{$signature}

REVIEW_REQUEST:
Dear {$reviewerName},

We invite you to review "{$submissionTitle}". Please respond by {$responseDueDate}: {$reviewUrl}

{$signature}

EDITOR_DECISION_ACCEPT:
Dear {$authorName},

We are pleased to accept "{$submissionTitle}" for publication.

{$signature}

EDITOR_DECISION_REVISIONS:
Dear {$authorName},

Revisions are required for "{$submissionTitle}". Reviewer comments follow.

{$reviewerComments}

{$signature}

EDITOR_DECISION_RESUBMIT:
Dear {$authorName},

We ask you to revise "{$submissionTitle}" and resubmit it for a new round of review.

{$reviewerComments}

{$signature}

EDITOR_DECISION_SEND_TO_EXTERNAL:
Dear {$authorName},

Your submission "{$submissionTitle}" has been sent for peer review. We will contact you when the reviews are in.

{$signature}

EDITOR_ASSIGN:
Dear {$recipientName},

You have been assigned to "{$submissionTitle}" as {$roleName}: {$submissionUrl}

{$message}

{$signature}

REVIEW_CONFIRM:
Dear {$editorName},

{$reviewerName} has accepted the request to review "{$submissionTitle}".

{$signature}

REVIEW_DECLINE:
Dear {$editorName},

{$reviewerName} has declined the request to review "{$submissionTitle}".

{$declineReason}

{$signature}

REVIEW_REMIND:
Dear {$reviewerName},

This is a reminder about your review of "{$submissionTitle}", due {$reviewDueDate}: {$reviewUrl}

{$signature}

REVIEW_CANCEL:
Dear {$reviewerName},

We no longer need your review of "{$submissionTitle}". Thank you for your willingness to help.

{$signature}

REVIEW_COMPLETE:
Dear {$editorName},

{$reviewerName} has submitted a review of "{$submissionTitle}": {$submissionUrl}

{$signature}

REVISED_VERSION_NOTIFY:
Dear {$editorName},

The author has uploaded a revised version of "{$submissionTitle}": {$submissionUrl}

{$signature}

DISCUSSION_NOTIFICATION:
Dear {$recipientName},

There is a new message in the discussion "{$discussionSubject}" on "{$submissionTitle}": {$submissionUrl}

{$signature}

EDITOR_DECISION_SEND_TO_PRODUCTION:
Dear {$authorName},

Your submission "{$submissionTitle}" has been sent to production. We will let you know when it is published.

{$signature}

ISSUE_PUBLISHED:
Dear {$recipientName},

A new issue of {$journalName} is available: {$issueUrl}

{$signature}

EDITOR_DECISION_DECLINE:
Dear {$authorName},

We regret that "{$submissionTitle}" cannot be accepted.

{$signature}
